# The presence Worker's base URL (presence/README.md), for the live "Observers · N" count,
# for example https://today-on-earth-presence.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev
# Leave it empty and the label reads plain "Observers" and nothing is requested.
# Copy to web/.env (ignored by git) for local use; CI passes the PRESENCE_URL repository variable.
VITE_PRESENCE_URL=
